    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d534">

                <pb facs="0777" n="761" sameAs="frus:frus1948v09/pg761"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">831.6363/4–3048: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Venezuela</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Carrigan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret   us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-04-30T18:00:00-04:30">April 30, 1948—6
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>334. Creole, Meneg and Shell are presently coordinating their views in close and
                    continuous collaboration with Embassy and four attachés. Our joint task is to
                    recommend detailed plans for implementing general program outlined Embtel 330
                    April 29<anchor n="1" xml:id="d534-f1"/> which will afford maximum protection
                    possible against sabotage and at same time minimize risk of government
                    opposition or political repercussions which might defeat our whole purpose and
                    prejudice position of the companies. …</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carrigan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
